    // R7-DEEP-AUDIT-2 ROUND 8 (SUG-C): Error.prototype.stack getter filter.
    // Error.prepareStackTrace only filters stacks when the host sets it.
    // Most user code uses the default string-based Error.stack, which
    // includes our patch script's filename ("prototype_hardener.js")
    // and our internal function names (__sre_*, safeOverride, etc.).
    // A fingerprinting script that catches an error inside one of our
    // patched APIs (e.g., navigator.connection.rtt) would see:
    //
    //   TypeError: Cannot read property 'x' of undefined
    //       at get rtt (prototype_hardener.js:4117:23)
    //       at <page code>
