    // Real Chrome exposes navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition().
    // Without a JS-side override, a real headless container returns
    // PERMISSION_DENIED for every call (or, worse, returns the host's
    // real coordinates via the geolocation API). The fingerprint is
    // the consistent "no permission" state across many sessions.
    //
