    // R7-DEEP-AUDIT-2 GAP 4.3: AudioContext latency patching.
    // baseLatency and outputLatency are hardware-determined on real
    // systems. For a returning PPTC persona, they must be stable
    // across visits. For different personas on the same hardware, they
    // must vary (otherwise the fingerprint is "all personas share the
    // same audio latency = same machine"). We add per-persona jitter
    // (microseconds) so the value is stable per persona but varies
